 md:py-32"},["DIV",{"class":"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14"},["DIV",{"class":" transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6","style":"transition-delay:0ms"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent"},"FAQ"],["H2",{"class":"mt-3 font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl tracking-tight"},"Questions people ask before starting."],["P",{"class":"mt-5 text-lg text-muted-foreground max-w-md"},"Have a different one? Reach out — a specialist will answer within one business day."],["A",{"class":"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-accent hover:gap-3 transition-all","href":"/contact"},"Ask a question ",["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["path",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"space-y-3"},["DIV",{"class":" transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6","style":"transition-delay:0ms"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-2xl border bg-card overflow-hidden transition-all border-primary/30 shadow-lift"},["BUTTON",{"class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left"},["SPAN",{"class":"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground"},"Is Local SEO different from traditional SEO?"],["SPAN",{"class":"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-minus h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M5 12h14"}]]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300","style":"grid-template-rows:1fr"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden"},["P",{"class":"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"},"Yes. Traditional SEO focuses on ranking websites for broad searches, while Local SEO is designed to help businesses appear in Google Maps and local search results. It relies on Google Business Profile optimization, local citations, reviews, location relevance, and other local ranking signals to attract nearby customers with high purchase intent."]]]]],["DIV",{"class":" transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6","style":"transition-delay:60ms"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-2xl border bg-card overflow-hidden transition-all border-border shadow-card"},["BUTTON",{"class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-4 p-5 text-left"},["SPAN",{"class":"text-[15px] font-semibold text-foreground"},"Do I need a physical location to benefit from Local SEO?"],["SPAN",{"class":"grid h-8 w-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-surface-muted text-muted-foreground"},["svg",{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"24","height":"24","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","stroke-width":"2","stroke-linecap":"round","stroke-linejoin":"round","class":"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4","aria-hidden":"true"},["path",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["path",{"d":"M12 5v14"}]]]],["DIV",{"class":"grid transition-all duration-300","style":"grid-template-rows:0fr"},["DIV",{"class":"overflow-hidden"},["P",{"class":"px-5 pb-5 text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed"},"Not necessarily. Service-area businesses such as plumbers, electricians, contractors, and mobile service providers can achieve strong local visibility without a storefront. The right Google Business Profile setup and a well-executed Local SEO strategy are what matter most."]]]]],["DIV",{"class":" transition-all duration-700 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6","style":"transition-delay:120ms"},["DIV",{"class":"rounded-2xl border bg-card overflow-hidden transition-all border-border shadow-card"},["BUTTON",{"class":"w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-